w_-fiWeWpW3PQxa804YdDX3GRmpczzdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEjI0JM4momnn64sSuQ8WjZWsE1Lx0dDBchAKkFAPjbxg&oe=6A8ECB82"}, "display_name": "Drum Circle", "keywords": ["Drum", "Music", "Piano", "Jam", "Songs"], "long_description": "Unleash your inner musician with *Drum Circle*! Step into a vibrant virtual world where you can play a variety of instruments using just your hands. Whether you're grooving on the conga drums, tapping out rhythms on the bongos, creating melodies on a keyboard, or shaking maracas to the beat, *Drum Circle* brings the joy of music-making to life in immersive VR.\n\n**Features:**\n- Play a range of instruments: congas, bongos, keyboards, and maracas!\n- Play along with *music tracks* or create your own rhythms and melodies\n- Intuitive hand-tracking lets you perform naturally without controllers\n- Get real-time feedback to stay on beat with BPM Indicator mode\n- Use passthrough to enhance real-world collaboration and participate in live music sessions\n\nGet ready to feel the rhythm, unleash your creativity, and make music like never before with *Drum Circle*!", "short_description": "Unleash your inner musician with Drum Circle! Step into a vibrant virtual world where you can play a variety of instruments using just your hands. Whether you're grooving on the conga drums, tapping out rhythms on the bongos, creating melodies on a keyboard, or shaking maracas to the beat, Drum Circle brings the joy of music-making to life in immersive VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisanreality.com/privacy-policy-for-drum-circle", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisan Effects", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://artisanreality.com/drum-circle", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188